<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-4bw+/aepP/YC94hEpVNVgiZdgIC5+VKNBQNGCHeKRQN+PtmoHDEXuppvnDJzQIu9" crossorigin="anonymous">
  <style>
   
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron&family=Roboto:wght@100&display=swap');
    p{
        font-family: sans-serif;
        color: #0D1321 ;
        font-size: 12px;
    }
    .readable{
        font-family: sans-serif;
    }
    h3{
        font-family: sans-serif;
        color: #0D1321 ;
    }
    .code-format{
        font-family: sans-serif;
        font-size: 35px;
        letter-spacing: 15px;
        margin-left: 15px;
    }
    .card{
        border-color: #0D1321 ;
        border-width: 3px ;
        background-color: transparent ;
    }
   
    .text-footer{
        font-size: 11px;
        color: darkgray;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center col-11 mt-2 mb-2 h-100">
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-center">Verify your email address</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 p-0 text-center readable">Thanks for starting the new Bus4U account creation process. We want to make sure it's really you. Please enter the following verification code when prompted. If you don't want to create an account, you can ignore this message. </p>
        
        <p class="mt-5 mb-1 p-0 h6 text-center">Your verification code is: </p>
        <div class="card mt-1 mb-2 ">
        <div class="card-body p-2 m-0 text-center ">
            <p class="mb-0 p-0 text-center code-format"><%= @verification_code %></p>
        </div>
        </div>


        <p class="mt-5 p-0 text-footer text-center readable">This message was produced and distributed by Bus4U ROMANIA SRL, Bl.6 Of.1-16 Cart.Florilor, Gheorgheni, HR 535500. © 2023, Bus4U ROMANIA SRL. All rights reserved. Bus4U is a registered trademark of Bus4U ROMANIA SRL, Inc. View our privacy policy.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>